  "_why": "Frozen resolved values for the 54 named colour-ramp aliases. brik-bds#1949. The existing #1739 suite checks that figma-tokens.css and color-ramps.generated.json AGREE — but both regenerate together from the Brand Kit, so a re-sync that moves a value keeps them agreeing and passes. This file is the independent constant that a re-sync cannot move.",
